<title>USA: Felcor files $500 mln debt, equity shelf.</title>
<headline>Felcor files $500 mln debt, equity shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Felcor Suite Hotels Inc filed Thursday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf offering of up to $500 million in debt securities, preferred, common shares and common stock warrants.</p>
<p>The Irving, Texas real estate investment trust said proceeds from the sale will be used by its operating partnership for general corporate purposes, which may include repaying outstanding debt, acquiring additional hotels and improving properties.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the filing.</p>
</text>
